; mini-firefox is the browser of 2004 as a page's programmer saw it:
; the same engine as mini-netscape (tools/mosaic's mosaic_engine, its
; extensions and style sheets on), and the page's scripts run
; (src/webapi), with a console and the tree beside the page.
